      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Thank you for clarifying, @{63cbea337d46b409827e402a|full_name}!\n\nThe VCC has never supported migration for unknown projects without a VRCSDK folder. However, that sounds like it might be an interesting feature for legacy project\n\nIf the VRCSDK folder has been removed, it may be possible to use the project with the VCC anyway - on a case-by-case basis.\n\nIf you are interested in a feature request to allow migrating unknown projects, please submit it via our GitHub board. https://github.com/vrchat-community/creator-companion/issues/new/choose",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
