  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-03-12T21:55:28.737Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello,\n\nSince the last update, there is no more migrate function on unknown projects, where the user has deleted the VRCSDK folder before importing the project into the VCC.\n\nIs it possible to add a migrate button for unknown projects like legacy ones? Even if we have to say that the VRCSDK has not been found and that it may not be a VRChat project or whatever.\n\nThank you!\n\nLusiiky",
